The adapted project retains the original SPDX copyright and license notices.

Changes made for KWin Active Window Outline include active-window focus
tracking, screen-level compositor rendering, configurable inside/outside
placement and outline offset, automatic configuration reloads, updated
packaging, and installation/uninstallation tooling.

Parts of the adaptation were developed with AI assistance and reviewed and
tested on KDE Plasma 6 / KWin 6.
